          <id>3411</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>Consignment sale version</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>نسخه فروش امانی</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>Versione delle vendite su commissione</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>Wersja sprzedaży komisowej</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Версия комиссионной продажи</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Konsinye satış sürümü</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Phiên bản bán hàng ký gửi</value>
          </title>
          <visible>true</visible>
          <enabled>true</enabled>
          <userVisible>
            <common>true</common>
          </userVisible>
          <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
            <segments>ConstantsSet.SelectConsignmentSalesVersion</segments>
          </dataPath>
          <toolTip>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>2.5: only consignment sales model 2.5 is used, but you can read/edit documents of consignment sales 2.0.
2.0/2.5: both models are used. You can enter new documents/catalogs for both 2.0 and 2.5 models.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>2.5: فقط مدل فروش امانی 2.5 استفاده می‌شود، اما می‌توانید اسناد فروش امانی 2.0 را بخوانید/ویرایش کنید.
2.0/2.5: هر دو مدل استفاده می‌شوند. می‌توانید اسناد/فهرست‌های جدید را برای هر دو مدل 2.0 و 2.5 وارد کنید.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>2.5 – используется только модель комиссии 2.5, документы по комиссии 2.0 доступны для просмотра/редактирования;
2.0/2.5 – используются обе модели. Ввод новых документов/справочников возможен как для модели 2.0, так и для 2.5.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>2.5: Sadece komisyon modeli 2.5 kullanılır, komisyon 2.0 kapsamında belgeler görüntülenebilir/düzenlenebilir. Yeni belgeler/referanslar sadece 2.5 modeli kapsamında girilebilir;
2.0/2.5: Her iki model de kullanılır. Yeni katalog belgeleri/referansları hem 2.0 hem de 2.5 modelleri için girilebilir.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>2.5 – chỉ sử dụng mô hình ký gửi 2.5, chứng từ ký gửi 2.0 được dùng để xem/soạn;
2.0/2.5 – sử dụng hai mô hình. Có thể nhập các chứng từ/danh mục mới đối với mô hình 2.0 và 2.5.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>2.5: only consignment sales model 2.5 is used, but you can read/edit documents of consignment sales 2.0.
2.0/2.5: both models are used. You can enter new documents/catalogs for both 2.0 and 2.5 models.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>2.5: only consignment sales model 2.5 is used, but you can read/edit documents of consignment sales 2.0.
2.0/2.5: both models are used. You can enter new documents/catalogs for both 2.0 and 2.5 models.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
          <handlers>
            <event>OnChange</event>
            <name>OnChangeAttribute</name>
          </handlers>
          <extendedTooltip>
