    <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
      <name>LocalizationGroupPaymentByElectronicCertificatesOfFSS</name>
      <id>3420</id>
      <displayImportance>Usual</displayImportance>
      <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
        <name>PaymentByElectronicCertificatesOfFSS</name>
        <id>3422</id>
        <title>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>Payment with digital certificates (FZ-491)</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>پرداخت با گواهی‌های دیجیتال (FZ-491)</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>Оплата электронными сертификатами (ФЗ-491)</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>Elektronik sertifikalarla ödeme (Federal Kanun -491)</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>Thanh toán bằng chứng thư điện tử (FZ-491)</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>Payment with digital certificates (FZ-491)</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>Payment with digital certificates (FZ-491)</value>
        </title>
        <visible>true</visible>
        <enabled>true</enabled>
        <userVisible>
          <common>true</common>
        </userVisible>
        <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
        <toolTipRepresentation>ShowBottom</toolTipRepresentation>
        <handlers>
          <event>OnChange</event>
          <name>OnChangeAttribute</name>
        </handlers>
        <extendedTooltip>
          <name>PaymentByElectronicCertificatesOfFSSExtendedTooltip</name>
          <id>3424</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>Allows you to keep accounting of goods from the classifier of the Social Insurance Fund of the Russian Federation and accept digital certificates (FZ-491) recorded to the MIR NSPK payment card.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>امکان حسابداری کالا از طبقه‌بندی صندوق بیمه اجتماعی فدراسیون روسیه و پذیرش گواهی‌های دیجیتال (FZ-491) ثبت‌شده در کارت پرداخت MIR NSPK را فراهم می‌کند.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Позволяет вести учет товаров из классификатора ФСС РФ, а также принимать к оплате электронные сертификаты (ФЗ-491), записанные на платежную карту НСПК МИР.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Rusya Federasyonu Federal Sigorta Sistemi sınıflandırıcısından ürünlerin kayıtlarının tutulmasına ve ayrıca Ulusal Ödeme Kartı Sistemi MIR ödeme kartına kaydedilen ödeme elektronik sertifikalarını (Federal Kanun-491) kabul edilmesine olanak tanır.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Cho phép quản lý hàng hóa từ bảng kê BHXH, cũng như tiếp nhận thanh toán chứng chỉ điện tử BHXH được ghi lại vào thẻ thanh toán của Hệ thống thẻ thanh toán quốc gia trên toàn thế giới.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>Allows you to keep accounting of goods from the classifier of the Social Insurance Fund of the Russian Federation and accept digital certificates (FZ-491) recorded to the MIR NSPK payment card.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>Allows you to keep accounting of goods from the classifier of the Social Insurance Fund of the Russian Federation and accept digital certificates (FZ-491) recorded to the MIR NSPK payment card.</value>
          </title>
          <type>Label</type>
          <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
          <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
          <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
            <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
          </extInfo>
        </extendedTooltip>
        <contextMenu>
          <name>PaymentByElectronicCertificatesOfFSSContextMenu</name>
          <id>3423</id>
          <autoFill>true</autoFill>
        </contextMenu>
        <type>CheckBoxField</type>
        <editMode>Enter</editMode>
        <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
        <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
        <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:CheckBoxFieldExtInfo"/>
