        </title>
        <toolTipRepresentation>ShowBottom</toolTipRepresentation>
        <extendedTooltip>
          <name>NSPKConnectionParametersGroupExtendedTooltip</name>
          <id>3426</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>To connect to the front office of digital NSPK certificates by the service address &lt;link https://api1.fes.nspk.ru/>https://api1.fes.nspk.ru&lt;/>, install root certificates of the National Certificate Authority to the storage of trusted root OS certificates.
Specify the parameters to connect to the NSPK service for the &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Organizations>company&lt;/> and for each of the &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM>cash&lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM> &lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM>registers&lt;/> that will accept payments with digital certificates (FZ-491).
Connect a &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms>POS&lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms> &lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms> terminal&lt;/> that accepts payments with digital MIR NSPK certificates to the cash register.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>برای اتصال به دفتر پیشخوان گواهی‌های دیجیتال NSPK از طریق آدرس سرویس &lt;link https://api1.fes.nspk.ru/>https://api1.fes.nspk.ru&lt;/>، گواهی‌های ریشه مرجع ملی صدور گواهی را در مخزن گواهی‌های ریشه مورد اعتماد سیستم‌عامل نصب کنید.
پارامترهای اتصال به سرویس NSPK را برای &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Organizations>شرکت&lt;/> و برای هر یک از &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM>صندوق‌های&lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM> &lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM>فروش&lt;/> که پرداخت با گواهی‌های دیجیتال (FZ-491) را می‌پذیرند مشخص کنید.
یک &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms>پایانه&lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms> &lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms>POS&lt;/> را که پرداخت با گواهی‌های دیجیتال MIR NSPK را می‌پذیرد به صندوق فروش متصل کنید.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Для соединения с ФЭС НСПК по адресу сервиса &lt;link https://api1.fes.nspk.ru/>https://api1.fes.nspk.ru&lt;/> необходимо установить корневые сертификаты Национального удостоверяющего центра в хранилище доверенных корневых сертификатов ОС.
Сертификаты доступны для скачивания по ссылке &lt;link https://www.gosuslugi.ru/crt>https://www.gosuslugi.ru/crt&lt;/>.
Дополнительно необходимо указать параметры подключения к сервису НСПК для &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Organizations>организации&lt;/> и каждой из &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM>касс&lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM> &lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM>ККМ&lt;/>, на которых предполагается принимать к оплате ЭС (ФЗ-491).
Также к кассе ККМ должен быть подключен &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms>эквайринговый&lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms> &lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms>терминал&lt;/> с возможностью приема оплаты электронным сертификатом НСПК МИР.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Hizmet adresindeki Elektronik Sertifika Ön Ofisi Ödeme Kartı Ulusal Sistemine &lt;link https://api1.fes.nspk.ru/>https://api1.fes.nspk.ru&lt;/>  bağlanmak için, Ulusal Sertifika Yetkilisinin kök sertifikalarını İşletim Sisteminin güvenilir kök sertifika deposuna yüklenmesi gerekir.
Sertifikalar bağlantıdan indirilebilir&lt;link https://www.gosuslugi.ru/crt>https://www.gosuslugi.ru/crt&lt;/>.
Ek olarak, iş yeri için Ödeme Kartı Ulusal Sistemi &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Organizations> hizmetine&lt;/> bağlanmak için parametreleri &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM>ve ödeme&lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM>&lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM> için Elektronik Sertifikaların kabul etmesi gereken yazar kasaların&lt;/> her birini belirtmeniz gerekir (Federal Kanun-491).
Ayrıca, elektronik bir Ödeme Kartı Ulusal Sistemi &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms>MIR sertifikası&lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms> &lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms> ile ödeme kabul etme&lt;/> kabiliyetine sahip bir PoS terminali yazar kasaya bağlanmalıdır.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Để kết nối với chứng thư điện tử NSPK theo địa chỉ dịch vụ &lt;link https://api1.fes.nspk.ru/>https://api1.fes.nspk.ru&lt;/> cần cài đặt chứng thư gốc của Trung tâm chứng thực nhà nước trong kho chứa chứng thư gốc đã chứng thực của Hệ điều hành.
Chỉ có thể tải chứng thư theo đường dẫn &lt;link https://www.gosuslugi.ru/crt>https://www.gosuslugi.ru/crt&lt;/>.
Cần chỉ ra bổ sung các tham số kết nối đến dịch vụ NSPK dành cho &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Organizations>doanh nghiệp&lt;/> và mỗi &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM>quầy&lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM> &lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM>thu ngân&lt;/> nhận thanh toán qua chứng thư điện tử.
Như vậy, cần kết nối thiết bị &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms>thẻ thanh toán&lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms> &lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms>với quầy thu ngân&lt;/> có tính năng nhận thanh toán bằng chứng thư điện tử NSPK MIR.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>To connect to the front office of digital NSPK certificates by the service address &lt;link https://api1.fes.nspk.ru/>https://api1.fes.nspk.ru&lt;/>, install root certificates of the National Certificate Authority to the storage of trusted root OS certificates.
Specify the parameters to connect to the NSPK service for the &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Organizations>company&lt;/> and for each of the &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM>cash&lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM> &lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM>registers&lt;/> that will accept payments with digital certificates (FZ-491).
Connect a &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms>POS&lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms> &lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms> terminal&lt;/> that accepts payments with digital MIR NSPK certificates to the cash register.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>To connect to the front office of digital NSPK certificates by the service address &lt;link https://api1.fes.nspk.ru/>https://api1.fes.nspk.ru&lt;/>, install root certificates of the National Certificate Authority to the storage of trusted root OS certificates.
Specify the parameters to connect to the NSPK service for the &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Organizations>company&lt;/> and for each of the &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM>cash&lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM> &lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.KassyKKM>registers&lt;/> that will accept payments with digital certificates (FZ-491).
Connect a &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms>POS&lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms> &lt;/>&lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Acquiring Terms> terminal&lt;/> that accepts payments with digital MIR NSPK certificates to the cash register.</value>
          </title>
          <formatted>true</formatted>
          <type>Label</type>
          <width>40</width>
          <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
          <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
            <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
          </extInfo>
        </extendedTooltip>
        <type>UsualGroup</type>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:UsualGroupExtInfo">
          <group>Vertical</group>
          <showLeftMargin>true</showLeftMargin>
          <united>true</united>
          <showTitle>true</showTitle>
          <throughAlign>Auto</throughAlign>
          <currentRowUse>Auto</currentRowUse>
        </extInfo>
